+# GT30Pro shader notes (4x Cortex-A510 efficiency cores)
+- Default ON: use_asynchronous_shaders, disk shader cache, driver pipeline cache.
+- Cap compute PSO warmup threads at min(4, hw/2) so compiles land on A510s, not the prime A715.
+- Hard thread affinity needs root; use background priority + small batches instead.
+- BOTW: enable_compute_pipelines=true, but unbounded compute PSO spam causes green-square bursts.
